{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18070","headline":"短灯檠歌 · 韩愈","name":"短灯檠歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长檠八尺空自长，短檠二尺便且光。\n黄帘绿幕朱户闭，风露气入秋堂凉。\n裁衣寄远泪眼暗，搔头频挑移近牀。\n太学儒生东鲁客，二十辞家来射策。\n夜书细字缀语言，两目眵昏头雪白。\n此时提携当案前，看书到晓那能眠。\n一朝富贵还自恣，长檠高张照珠翠。\n吁嗟世事无不然，墙角君看短檠弃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}